(4714877, 680279, 70896, '<td valign="top">I just saw this movie, after reading the book. What a wonderful story. What I love about your photo is that he looks so small against the trees, which is how I presume Alexander Supertramp felt.  Good job! 9</td>', 'I just saw this movie, after reading the book. What a wonderful story. What I love about your photo is that he looks so small against the trees, which is how I presume Alexander Supertramp felt.  Good job! 9', '2008-05-21 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714880, 680287, 76430, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting perspective.  It seems a little rushed though due to the focus not being on her face, noisy background, distracting dark things in the background, not waiting for a nice expression on the face, and this angle and focus overemphasizing the breast area, which is probably not what you want to do if this is your beautiful teenage daughter getting ready for the prom.  Also we are missing the beast.</td>', 'Unique and interesting perspective.  It seems a little rushed though due to the focus not being on her face, noisy background, distracting dark things in the background, not waiting for a nice expression on the face, and this angle and focus overemphasizing the breast area, which is probably not what you want to do if this is your beautiful teenage daughter getting ready for the prom.  Also we are missing the beast.', '2008-05-21 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714881, 679631, 75532, '<td valign="top">Curly telephone line, clever :)</td>', 'Curly telephone line, clever :)', '2008-05-21 11:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714888, 680081, 6667, '<td valign="top">Forget everything else about this image. . . the expression on the baby''s face. . .PRICELESS ! BOL 8</td>', 'Forget everything else about this image. . . the expression on the baby''s face. . .PRICELESS ! BOL 8', '2008-05-21 11:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714890, 679468, 92867, '<td valign="top">I like the title. Didn''t get it at first (I''m slow!) Very creative.</td>', 'I like the title. Didn''t get it at first (I''m slow!) Very creative.', '2008-05-21 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714904, 680330, 76430, '<td valign="top">You''ll get this a lot, and I''m sure you won''t repeat it, but it''s far too small to see any detail.  Use the 640 pixels allowed.  I see white flowers but can''t tell what the red is.</td>', 'You''ll get this a lot, and I''m sure you won''t repeat it, but it''s far too small to see any detail.  Use the 640 pixels allowed.  I see white flowers but can''t tell what the red is.', '2008-05-21 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714908, 678752, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Too bad you can''t clone out the power lines in basic editing.  I think boosting the green saturation a bit would help.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Too bad you can''t clone out the power lines in basic editing.  I think boosting the green saturation a bit would help.', '2008-05-21 11:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714911, 680231, 61961, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  A negative of branches reflected in water, rotated 90 degrees, yes?  They do look something like birds, though very abstract.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  A negative of branches reflected in water, rotated 90 degrees, yes?  They do look something like birds, though very abstract.', '2008-05-21 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
