(4714988, 680081, 61961, '<td valign="top">Precious and <i>very</i> funny.  The fact that the baby is smiling at the camera just makes it all the more surreal and comic.</td>', 'Precious and very funny.  The fact that the baby is smiling at the camera just makes it all the more surreal and comic.', '2008-05-21 12:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
