(4714995, 680356, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Not sure what that white vertical thing in the background is.  If it''s a waterfall, I like it.  But it does grab my attention.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Not sure what that white vertical thing in the background is.  If it''s a waterfall, I like it.  But it does grab my attention.', '2008-05-21 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
