(4717039, 679993, 33535, '<td valign="top">"A magazine or book containing lurid subject matter and characteristically printed on rough, unfinished paper."<br/>well, yours truly match that discription and i like how you kinda chaotically composed the books around tarantino''s face. crop could have been a tad tighter and focus point on the face rather than on the book behind him.<br/>giving you an 8 for creatively converting the title into an image and for picking the best movie evah ;)</td>', '"A magazine or book containing lurid subject matter and characteristically printed on rough, unfinished paper."well, yours truly match that discription and i like how you kinda chaotically composed the books around tarantino''s face. crop could have been a tad tighter and focus point on the face rather than on the book behind him.giving you an 8 for creatively converting the title into an image and for picking the best movie evah ;)', '2008-05-22 06:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
