(4717044, 679864, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great use of rays! I really like this photo. The only nitpick I have is he looks too much like he''s reading the newspaper which for me softens the blow of his cold harsh reality just a tad and with a title like that I think the harshness should be amped up not down. Not that I wish more on this person just that maybe there was a slightly different moment in time that was a bit more defining, if I am to nitpick. That said, this is head and shoulders over most of the entries and is in my top 5. Good luck!</td>', 'Great use of rays! I really like this photo. The only nitpick I have is he looks too much like he''s reading the newspaper which for me softens the blow of his cold harsh reality just a tad and with a title like that I think the harshness should be amped up not down. Not that I wish more on this person just that maybe there was a slightly different moment in time that was a bit more defining, if I am to nitpick. That said, this is head and shoulders over most of the entries and is in my top 5. Good luck!', '2008-05-22 06:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717046, 680561, 41337, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657188" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif"/></a> <br/> <br/>It would be interesting to know if this was setup or not. It looks like it was but only because it''s so perfect. Either way it doesn''t matter. I love how the windows are such a strong element in this photograph. It allows the subject to reveal itself as quitely as a whisper but as an entry it roars. Easily the best in the challenge and my YankO Blue. Good luck.</td>', '  It would be interesting to know if this was setup or not. It looks like it was but only because it''s so perfect. Either way it doesn''t matter. I love how the windows are such a strong element in this photograph. It allows the subject to reveal itself as quitely as a whisper but as an entry it roars. Easily the best in the challenge and my YankO Blue. Good luck.', '2008-05-22 06:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717047, 680642, 33535, '<td valign="top">nice action shot. i''m not a big fan of these training shows, as i know how the animals have way too little space in the aquaria, but since this is a photography site and not greenpeace.com i''m trying not to take that fact into account when figuring out your score ;)<br/>the whale/dolphin(?) seems blurry, but imo that adds to the motion and "wildness" of the shot. the man in the bottom right corner adds a nice touch and sets off the picture. i think this could have been much more powerful in b&amp;w.<br/>6</td>', 'nice action shot. i''m not a big fan of these training shows, as i know how the animals have way too little space in the aquaria, but since this is a photography site and not greenpeace.com i''m trying not to take that fact into account when figuring out your score ;)the whale/dolphin(?) seems blurry, but imo that adds to the motion and "wildness" of the shot. the man in the bottom right corner adds a nice touch and sets off the picture. i think this could have been much more powerful in b&w.6', '2008-05-22 06:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717048, 680449, 33535, '<td valign="top">lovly lighting and b&amp;w tones, you got the perfect amount of blur in the ghost, too! 9</td>', 'lovly lighting and b&w tones, you got the perfect amount of blur in the ghost, too! 9', '2008-05-22 06:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717049, 680449, 41337, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657189" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif"/></a> <br/> <br/>Ghost indeed and a scary looking one too. I don''t know what it is about shadows and concrete but they go well together. However, what puts this over the top for me is that bright light at the very bottom contrasting the dark figure. I''m a sucker for religious and ying and yang themes so you get my YankO Red. Good luck!</td>', '  Ghost indeed and a scary looking one too. I don''t know what it is about shadows and concrete but they go well together. However, what puts this over the top for me is that bright light at the very bottom contrasting the dark figure. I''m a sucker for religious and ying and yang themes so you get my YankO Red. Good luck!', '2008-05-22 06:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717050, 680355, 33535, '<td valign="top">beautiful sheltie! colors are slightly off (i think b&amp;w would of been nice for this image), angle is not too impressive, maybe chosing a lower perspective would have given a better portrait feel here. 5</td>', 'beautiful sheltie! colors are slightly off (i think b&w would of been nice for this image), angle is not too impressive, maybe chosing a lower perspective would have given a better portrait feel here. 5', '2008-05-22 07:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717051, 680231, 41337, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657190" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif"/></a> <br/> <br/>Inverted and rotated clockwise? They do kind of look like birds but not just any birds, deranged ones much like Alfred''s... and with that my YankO Yellow. Good luck!</td>', '  Inverted and rotated clockwise? They do kind of look like birds but not just any birds, deranged ones much like Alfred''s... and with that my YankO Yellow. Good luck!', '2008-05-22 07:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
