(4718775, 679487, 84685, '<td valign="top">Such a lovable little one! :o) The mirror is a great idea!  Most of the time when I do reflective portraits, I keep whichever image that is looking into the camera in focus.  This draws my eyes to the reflection, rather than the down cast eyes of the top image.<br/>I love the light on this and the sepia tone gives it such a sweet look.  I bet the parents (if you''re not it) were in love with this!</td>', 'Such a lovable little one! :o) The mirror is a great idea!  Most of the time when I do reflective portraits, I keep whichever image that is looking into the camera in focus.  This draws my eyes to the reflection, rather than the down cast eyes of the top image.I love the light on this and the sepia tone gives it such a sweet look.  I bet the parents (if you''re not it) were in love with this!', '2008-05-23 01:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
