(4720854, 680488, 59335, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like it a lot.  The tones are a bit strong in my opinion if you were going for that sepia tone look.</td>', 'Nice.  I like it a lot.  The tones are a bit strong in my opinion if you were going for that sepia tone look.', '2008-05-24 02:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4720860, 680588, 59335, '<td valign="top">Great!  I like how you incorporated the ''punch'', the ''drunk'' and the ''love''.  The girl in the back has the perfect amount of light on her. The tones are great .  Outfit is great.  I wish I could see a tiny bit more of the boot.<br/> <br/>7! (a very good score coming from me :-p )</td>', 'Great!  I like how you incorporated the ''punch'', the ''drunk'' and the ''love''.  The girl in the back has the perfect amount of light on her. The tones are great .  Outfit is great.  I wish I could see a tiny bit more of the boot. 7! (a very good score coming from me :-p )', '2008-05-24 02:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4720862, 679778, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I saw the movie but I don''t recognize anything here other than maybe red martian soil.  The details are very small and hard to distinguish.  Maybe I need to see the movie again.</td>', 'Hmm...I saw the movie but I don''t recognize anything here other than maybe red martian soil.  The details are very small and hard to distinguish.  Maybe I need to see the movie again.', '2008-05-24 02:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
