(4721555, 679656, 61961, '<td valign="top">Fireworks photos as a genre don''t grab me, I suppose partly because I''ve never tried to take them -- I understand it''s harder than it looks.  This one stands out because of the atypical perspective (not taken from street level), and time of day: I love that the sky still has color.</td>', 'Fireworks photos as a genre don''t grab me, I suppose partly because I''ve never tried to take them -- I understand it''s harder than it looks.  This one stands out because of the atypical perspective (not taken from street level), and time of day: I love that the sky still has color.', '2008-05-24 15:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
