(4721596, 680427, 83313, '<td valign="top">Never heard of that movie, but that does not mean anything. i''m not a huge movie watcher. Wonderful shot, however. Love the patterns in the sky and the reflections. I also like the bluish tone you chose.</td>', 'Never heard of that movie, but that does not mean anything. i''m not a huge movie watcher. Wonderful shot, however. Love the patterns in the sky and the reflections. I also like the bluish tone you chose.', '2008-05-24 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
