(4721599, 679757, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good, but a couple of nitpicks. The boy is a bit too far over in the frame, with his heel cut off and his face is in shadows. Perhaps some fill flash, or use of the shadow/highlight adjustment could help with that.</td>', 'This is pretty good, but a couple of nitpicks. The boy is a bit too far over in the frame, with his heel cut off and his face is in shadows. Perhaps some fill flash, or use of the shadow/highlight adjustment could help with that.', '2008-05-24 16:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721607, 680456, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to have lost some detail in the resizing to 640 pixels. I see a fair amount of jaggies, and pixelation. If there were more detail showing, I think this would be very good. I''d suggest playing with some different resizing algorithms (Bicubic, bilinear, etc.) to find what works best for your photos.</td>', 'Seems to have lost some detail in the resizing to 640 pixels. I see a fair amount of jaggies, and pixelation. If there were more detail showing, I think this would be very good. I''d suggest playing with some different resizing algorithms (Bicubic, bilinear, etc.) to find what works best for your photos.', '2008-05-24 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721609, 680002, 83313, '<td valign="top">That movie didn''t do well in the theaters, but I really liked it. Nice smooth reflections here.</td>', 'That movie didn''t do well in the theaters, but I really liked it. Nice smooth reflections here.', '2008-05-24 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721611, 680226, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too bright. You also should have used the full 640 pixels allowed in at least one direction.</td>', 'Maybe a little too bright. You also should have used the full 640 pixels allowed in at least one direction.', '2008-05-24 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721613, 680561, 83313, '<td valign="top">The horse and rider are a bit dark and easy to overlook in this shot. Brighten it up a touch, and I think it would score a point higher.</td>', 'The horse and rider are a bit dark and easy to overlook in this shot. Brighten it up a touch, and I think it would score a point higher.', '2008-05-24 16:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721617, 680603, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fairly well composed, good colors and detail, interesting action. It''s not really grabbing me for some reason, but I can''t nail down why. I''ll get back to this and update if it hits me what it is.</td>', 'Fairly well composed, good colors and detail, interesting action. It''s not really grabbing me for some reason, but I can''t nail down why. I''ll get back to this and update if it hits me what it is.', '2008-05-24 16:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
