(4722026, 679468, 91496, '<td valign="top">I really like the pun a lot.  The lines near her cheek are sort of odd, and the man on the cover it sort of creepy as he seems to be outside of the magazine.</td>', 'I really like the pun a lot.  The lines near her cheek are sort of odd, and the man on the cover it sort of creepy as he seems to be outside of the magazine.', '2008-05-24 22:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722030, 680080, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great color and textures on the dune.  Too bad the sky had such a poor color that day.</td>', 'Great color and textures on the dune.  Too bad the sky had such a poor color that day.', '2008-05-24 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722033, 680287, 91496, '<td valign="top">Is she both, otherwise you are missing a beast.  Need a wider DOF to get her face in focus.</td>', 'Is she both, otherwise you are missing a beast.  Need a wider DOF to get her face in focus.', '2008-05-24 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722038, 680486, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow and use of colors.  I think the texture color changes of the 3 main subjects make them too mismatched.  Cropping the left third (as a portait) may have empasized the rainbow more.</td>', 'Nice rainbow and use of colors.  I think the texture color changes of the 3 main subjects make them too mismatched.  Cropping the left third (as a portait) may have empasized the rainbow more.', '2008-05-24 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722040, 680081, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- made me laugh.  Crying baby would have made it better.  White powdery stuff on dishwasher looked a little odd.</td>', 'Great shot -- made me laugh.  Crying baby would have made it better.  White powdery stuff on dishwasher looked a little odd.', '2008-05-24 23:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722042, 680289, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Angle and curves are great.  Sky and concrete are a little weak.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Angle and curves are great.  Sky and concrete are a little weak.', '2008-05-24 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722044, 680432, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Having the dead lilies centered in the shot sort of detracts from the effect.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Having the dead lilies centered in the shot sort of detracts from the effect.', '2008-05-24 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722045, 680622, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I like how you had the stem fill the upper space, giving a reason for the flower to be in the lower half.</td>', 'Cute.  I like how you had the stem fill the upper space, giving a reason for the flower to be in the lower half.', '2008-05-24 23:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722047, 680586, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Watch your horizon as this one has a tilt.</td>', 'Very beautiful. Watch your horizon as this one has a tilt.', '2008-05-24 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722050, 679467, 91915, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Terrible movie. My dad was an extra in it because it was filmed here in my hometown.</td>', 'Nice photo. Terrible movie. My dad was an extra in it because it was filmed here in my hometown.', '2008-05-24 23:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722054, 679993, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  NOt sure that the open books add much, using all covers may have been more intersting. Not sure what to make of the man''s face.  It could be a book or a photo.  Seem unconnected intent of photographing a bunch of old books.</td>', 'Great idea.  NOt sure that the open books add much, using all covers may have been more intersting. Not sure what to make of the man''s face.  It could be a book or a photo.  Seem unconnected intent of photographing a bunch of old books.', '2008-05-24 23:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722057, 680439, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Placemat is a little distracting as is it''s rounded like edge.</td>', 'Great idea.  Placemat is a little distracting as is it''s rounded like edge.', '2008-05-24 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722058, 680488, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and nice movie tie-in</td>', 'Nice photo and nice movie tie-in', '2008-05-24 23:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722059, 680355, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog and nicely done photo.  Raking the lawn would have helped the shot a lot.</td>', 'Very cute dog and nicely done photo.  Raking the lawn would have helped the shot a lot.', '2008-05-24 23:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722061, 680090, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool, edgey, grainy and on topic to the title.</td>', 'Cool, edgey, grainy and on topic to the title.', '2008-05-24 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722063, 680420, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cape Ann.  Very nice.</td>', 'Cape Ann.  Very nice.', '2008-05-24 23:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722066, 679485, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  Good use of B&amp;W.  Background (not that you have much control over it at these shutter speeds) is a little busy.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  Good use of B&W.  Background (not that you have much control over it at these shutter speeds) is a little busy.', '2008-05-24 23:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722067, 680437, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Wider DOF may have worked better for my taste.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Wider DOF may have worked better for my taste.', '2008-05-24 23:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722069, 680338, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute pun, but really a DNMC since it is not a real movie.</td>', 'Cute pun, but really a DNMC since it is not a real movie.', '2008-05-24 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722072, 679461, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Maybe crop the top set of half stones as it adds another set of lines in a shot filled with lines.  That bench looks painful -- I hate to sit on either end and lean back,</td>', 'Nice photo.  Maybe crop the top set of half stones as it adds another set of lines in a shot filled with lines.  That bench looks painful -- I hate to sit on either end and lean back,', '2008-05-24 23:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722075, 680001, 91496, '<td valign="top">Yummy.  Nice interpretation of the title.  Like how the food is shot and the textures.  The hand needs something.  Maybe a fork or to be reaching for something specific.</td>', 'Yummy.  Nice interpretation of the title.  Like how the food is shot and the textures.  The hand needs something.  Maybe a fork or to be reaching for something specific.', '2008-05-24 23:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722076, 680262, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but execution does not appeal to me.  Wet muddy, slimey texture is not pleasing to my eye at all.  Angle and DOF are also a little off.</td>', 'Nice idea, but execution does not appeal to me.  Wet muddy, slimey texture is not pleasing to my eye at all.  Angle and DOF are also a little off.', '2008-05-24 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722077, 680225, 91496, '<td valign="top">Well done. A nice photo and a nice take on the movie theme.  I only count 11 visable, but assumed the 2nd row had 4 as well.</td>', 'Well done. A nice photo and a nice take on the movie theme.  I only count 11 visable, but assumed the 2nd row had 4 as well.', '2008-05-24 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722081, 679656, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great fireworks shot.  I would have cropped it on the top half and skipped the reflection. I think you are trying to do too much in one photo.</td>', 'Great fireworks shot.  I would have cropped it on the top half and skipped the reflection. I think you are trying to do too much in one photo.', '2008-05-24 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722138, 680242, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee - good movie title for your image. The lighting seems a little much here and there, but overall a good insect macro. Nicely done.</td>', 'Tee hee - good movie title for your image. The lighting seems a little much here and there, but overall a good insect macro. Nicely done.', '2008-05-25 01:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722141, 680499, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! Excellent storm clouds - I love watching nature roll in like that. Good tonal values too. Personally, I''m not crazy about the border, but a really nice photo.</td>', 'Wow! Excellent storm clouds - I love watching nature roll in like that. Good tonal values too. Personally, I''m not crazy about the border, but a really nice photo.', '2008-05-25 01:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722144, 680694, 41675, '<td valign="top">I haven''t heard of this particular movie, but I take you at your word. Your image appears grainy and I wish that little blur behind the photographer wasn''t there, but I like your composition otherwise/</td>', 'I haven''t heard of this particular movie, but I take you at your word. Your image appears grainy and I wish that little blur behind the photographer wasn''t there, but I like your composition otherwise/', '2008-05-25 01:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722147, 680107, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great fairy tale-like quality. For me, it''s the natural lighting that sets it all off right. Just an all around sweet, wholesome image.</td>', 'Great fairy tale-like quality. For me, it''s the natural lighting that sets it all off right. Just an all around sweet, wholesome image.', '2008-05-25 01:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722149, 680569, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape image. I like the reflections.</td>', 'Nice cityscape image. I like the reflections.', '2008-05-25 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722151, 680080, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Title fits perfectly. Your image brings the word "desolate" to mind. Barren and lonely or Moses looking out across the desert. I like the composition and lighting. Good shot.</td>', ':-) Title fits perfectly. Your image brings the word "desolate" to mind. Barren and lonely or Moses looking out across the desert. I like the composition and lighting. Good shot.', '2008-05-25 01:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722152, 680427, 90474, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but I wonder what it would have looked like with the water line slightly lower in the frame.</td>', 'I really like this, but I wonder what it would have looked like with the water line slightly lower in the frame.', '2008-05-25 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722153, 680545, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall I like your image. For me, there''s something missing to give it that extra....wow. Maybe its the lighting or a larger area in focus...something. Sorry I can''t be more technically accurate, that''s not my style. Good title though.</td>', 'Overall I like your image. For me, there''s something missing to give it that extra....wow. Maybe its the lighting or a larger area in focus...something. Sorry I can''t be more technically accurate, that''s not my style. Good title though.', '2008-05-25 01:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722160, 680279, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first impression of your photo is he''s taking a shortcut - doesn''t seem "wild" as in your title. Other than that, it''s not a bad photo yet doesn''t keep my interest as well as other photos in the challenge. Perhaps if there was another person or maybe if the photo was taken from different angle, like ground up, it made add interest.</td>', 'My first impression of your photo is he''s taking a shortcut - doesn''t seem "wild" as in your title. Other than that, it''s not a bad photo yet doesn''t keep my interest as well as other photos in the challenge. Perhaps if there was another person or maybe if the photo was taken from different angle, like ground up, it made add interest.', '2008-05-25 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722161, 680586, 90474, '<td valign="top">I looked at it for long time and couldn''t find anything to complain about. I like it.</td>', 'I looked at it for long time and couldn''t find anything to complain about. I like it.', '2008-05-25 01:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722164, 680451, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the lighting and composition. The tree and fence in the background detract a bit for me, but I think that''s because they''re so near the horse''s head.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the lighting and composition. The tree and fence in the background detract a bit for me, but I think that''s because they''re so near the horse''s head.', '2008-05-25 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722165, 680486, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good after the storm and rainbow image. The yellow of the train car enhances the yellow spectrum of the rainbow and offers a nice contrast to the sky.</td>', 'Good after the storm and rainbow image. The yellow of the train car enhances the yellow spectrum of the rainbow and offers a nice contrast to the sky.', '2008-05-25 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722166, 680590, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Nice sunset shot. Good, warm colors and composition. Title works nicely - haven''t seen that movie in years.</td>', ':-) Nice sunset shot. Good, warm colors and composition. Title works nicely - haven''t seen that movie in years.', '2008-05-25 01:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722169, 680414, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, cute, fuzzy baby animals are always sweet to look at. I wish there was a bit more saturation, but again, a sweet photo.</td>', 'Awww, cute, fuzzy baby animals are always sweet to look at. I wish there was a bit more saturation, but again, a sweet photo.', '2008-05-25 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722170, 680001, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - good image for the title. Actually, even though it''s close to midnight as I vote on your entry, that breakfast looks really, really good.</td>', 'Lol - good image for the title. Actually, even though it''s close to midnight as I vote on your entry, that breakfast looks really, really good.', '2008-05-25 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722173, 680316, 90474, '<td valign="top">I dream of better things.  This is a disturbing, but excellent photo.</td>', 'I dream of better things.  This is a disturbing, but excellent photo.', '2008-05-25 01:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722185, 680524, 90474, '<td valign="top">The duct tape is a nice touch.</td>', 'The duct tape is a nice touch.', '2008-05-25 01:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722191, 679487, 90474, '<td valign="top">More light on the right.</td>', 'More light on the right.', '2008-05-25 02:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722192, 679702, 93411, '<td valign="top">WTF</td>', 'WTF', '2008-05-25 02:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
