(4729457, 680164, 77009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I do think a tighter crop may have been better.<br/> <br/>For all who are interested the cloud is a <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lenticular_cloud" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lenticular cloud</a>.  They are a sign of high winds and bad weather on the mountain.  I climbed Rainier a couple years ago and it is a fantastic place. You could spend your whole life photographing the park.  <br/></td>', 'Nice shot, though I do think a tighter crop may have been better. For all who are interested the cloud is a lenticular cloud.  They are a sign of high winds and bad weather on the mountain.  I climbed Rainier a couple years ago and it is a fantastic place. You could spend your whole life photographing the park.  ', '2008-05-28 09:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729462, 679924, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a>o, wow.  this is just, wow.  the subtlety of the figure, the long hair becoming a living thing, the harshness of the wood and white.  an image you must look at carefully and well before understanding comes.  then when it does, darkness and heat along with it.  mmmmmm.</td>', 'o, wow.  this is just, wow.  the subtlety of the figure, the long hair becoming a living thing, the harshness of the wood and white.  an image you must look at carefully and well before understanding comes.  then when it does, darkness and heat along with it.  mmmmmm.', '2008-05-28 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729465, 680454, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> not only is it a book i love (and movie i liked) but the image is wonderful.  the colours, those golds and blues, the flecks of pigeon dust, are, well, lovely.  the implied motion in the impact trace remind me greatly of Giacomo Balla''s <a href="//cache.eb.com/eb/image?id=13209&amp;rendTypeId=4" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Dynamism of a Dog on a Leash</a>.  nicely done indeed.</td>', ' not only is it a book i love (and movie i liked) but the image is wonderful.  the colours, those golds and blues, the flecks of pigeon dust, are, well, lovely.  the implied motion in the impact trace remind me greatly of Giacomo Balla''s Dynamism of a Dog on a Leash.  nicely done indeed.', '2008-05-28 09:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729470, 679766, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> another wonderful movie and book, and a great evocation of feeling.  the echoes of shapes and textures are superb.  the known but unseen softness of the sheep and the seen softness of the hair; the solidity of the stone and the visual solidity of the sheep; the repetition of shapes with variation through the whole composition are so effective.  the warm white tone makes the whole thing glow.  yes, indeedy.</td>', ' another wonderful movie and book, and a great evocation of feeling.  the echoes of shapes and textures are superb.  the known but unseen softness of the sheep and the seen softness of the hair; the solidity of the stone and the visual solidity of the sheep; the repetition of shapes with variation through the whole composition are so effective.  the warm white tone makes the whole thing glow.  yes, indeedy.', '2008-05-28 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4729474, 680231, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> ooo, this is so cool.  the birds created from submerged sticks.  flight from death.  the tones are disturbing, the effect nightmarish; this is not an easy image at all.  well done indeed.</td>', ' ooo, this is so cool.  the birds created from submerged sticks.  flight from death.  the tones are disturbing, the effect nightmarish; this is not an easy image at all.  well done indeed.', '2008-05-28 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729475, 679261, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> the simplicity of the image is misleading; a lovely deep tonal study, subtle and strong.  the line, relaxed and unused, implies less about fishing than meditation.  a dark and deep image.</td>', ' the simplicity of the image is misleading; a lovely deep tonal study, subtle and strong.  the line, relaxed and unused, implies less about fishing than meditation.  a dark and deep image.', '2008-05-28 09:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729480, 680573, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> one of the illustrative images that i really like.  the effect is very well done, dark and grainy, threat pouring from the screen.</td>', ' one of the illustrative images that i really like.  the effect is very well done, dark and grainy, threat pouring from the screen.', '2008-05-28 09:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729486, 680561, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> an image that whispers, but it can be heard over many others.  the regularity of the windows, the light and dark, the hints of the horse, all combine to make a very powerful image.  the composition works very well indeed.</td>', ' an image that whispers, but it can be heard over many others.  the regularity of the windows, the light and dark, the hints of the horse, all combine to make a very powerful image.  the composition works very well indeed.', '2008-05-28 09:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729487, 680002, 80096, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments! This one came out better than I thought it would. ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments! This one came out better than I thought it would. ;-)', '2008-05-28 09:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4729488, 680449, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> there''s just something about the blurry figure going down stairs shots.  they work so well.  and this is a great example of one.  these dark tones are lovely.  the echoing bands of light complement each other perfectly.</td>', ' there''s just something about the blurry figure going down stairs shots.  they work so well.  and this is a great example of one.  these dark tones are lovely.  the echoing bands of light complement each other perfectly.', '2008-05-28 09:33:21.000000', NULL, 0),
