(4729511, 680454, 30982, '<td valign="top">You received high marks from me as well.  Some of us have very eclectic tastes and really do appreciate the shots that are just a bit beyond the norm.  Well done.  I had no idea what it was, but what it was was perfect as presented so I had no need to know what it was.  Hopefully that makes sense!</td>', 'You received high marks from me as well.  Some of us have very eclectic tastes and really do appreciate the shots that are just a bit beyond the norm.  Well done.  I had no idea what it was, but what it was was perfect as presented so I had no need to know what it was.  Hopefully that makes sense!', '2008-05-28 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
