(4729848, 680316, 41554, '<td valign="top">And here we are, drunk with petrol and worried that our luxurious lifestyles are in danger, while elsewhere in the planet the battles being fought are far more important and primeval.<br/> <br/>Is it really so hard to realize we are just ONE? That we are all connected and our common fate depends on what we do and how we act as a species?</td>', 'And here we are, drunk with petrol and worried that our luxurious lifestyles are in danger, while elsewhere in the planet the battles being fought are far more important and primeval. Is it really so hard to realize we are just ONE? That we are all connected and our common fate depends on what we do and how we act as a species?', '2008-05-28 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
