(4730084, 680107, 69668, '<td valign="top"><i>Can you give me anything why you shoot raw?</i> <br/> <br/>With RAW you have more wiggle room to make adjustments on a picture.  The sliders make it very easy to adjust exposure, contrast, saturation, and other details without losing any information on the picture.  Thanks for the nice comment. :O)</td>', 'Can you give me anything why you shoot raw?  With RAW you have more wiggle room to make adjustments on a picture.  The sliders make it very easy to adjust exposure, contrast, saturation, and other details without losing any information on the picture.  Thanks for the nice comment. :O)', '2008-05-28 12:55:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730089, 680107, 69668, '<td valign="top"><br/><i>Jennifer! You''re so consistently amazing! As soon as any one of your pictures pops up on my screen, my heart instantly and involuntarily turns to mush :) <br/> <br/> <br/>I gave this a 10 Jennifer...I thought it deserved a ribbon...well done on an outstanding, if not underrated image <br/> </i> <br/> <br/>Ahhh....thanks Sandy and Enzo for the really nice comments.</td>', 'Jennifer! You''re so consistently amazing! As soon as any one of your pictures pops up on my screen, my heart instantly and involuntarily turns to mush :)   I gave this a 10 Jennifer...I thought it deserved a ribbon...well done on an outstanding, if not underrated image    Ahhh....thanks Sandy and Enzo for the really nice comments.', '2008-05-28 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
