(4730255, 679461, 66635, '<td valign="top">Congrats Deb.  I like this one a lot.  It''s very simple, but very, very nice.</td>', 'Congrats Deb.  I like this one a lot.  It''s very simple, but very, very nice.', '2008-05-28 14:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730257, 680164, 66635, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that this didn''t do better.  I had you pegged for the blue.  It''s just an amazing photo and really, really well done.  I disagree about the tighter crop suggestion.  I''d love to see this picture hanging on my wall over a wide piece of furniture like a couch or a bed.  It''s just awesome.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-28 13:09:31.</i></td>', 'I''m amazed that this didn''t do better.  I had you pegged for the blue.  It''s just an amazing photo and really, really well done.  I disagree about the tighter crop suggestion.  I''d love to see this picture hanging on my wall over a wide piece of furniture like a couch or a bed.  It''s just awesome.', '2008-05-28 14:05:15.000000', '2008-05-28 14:09:31.000000', 0),
(4730273, 680081, 9462, '<td valign="top">Two in a row from me!</td>', 'Two in a row from me!', '2008-05-28 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730279, 680080, 66635, '<td valign="top">I''m very happy about this because now all four of my front page images are 6.0 or above.  If I had any specific goals, that was one of them.  It''s a bummer the sky wasn''t nicer that morning; but you make do with what you''ve got.  It was a great trip out to the sands.  I wish you all could go there.</td>', 'I''m very happy about this because now all four of my front page images are 6.0 or above.  If I had any specific goals, that was one of them.  It''s a bummer the sky wasn''t nicer that morning; but you make do with what you''ve got.  It was a great trip out to the sands.  I wish you all could go there.', '2008-05-28 14:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730283, 680499, 60195, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another stellar image (and the ribbon that goes along with it) Enzo!  Interesting to see that you''ve changed your toning , and DPC still loves it! This perspective makes it look so surreal... there''s so much to look at.  Well done :O)</td>', 'Congrats on another stellar image (and the ribbon that goes along with it) Enzo!  Interesting to see that you''ve changed your toning , and DPC still loves it! This perspective makes it look so surreal... there''s so much to look at.  Well done :O)', '2008-05-28 14:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730307, 680231, 44877, '<td valign="top">I absolutely loved this during voting and gave it high marks. It''s not surprising that it didn''t score higher considering its outstanding artistic quality. So I''m very happy to see that you received awards of peer appreciation, which are worth a lot, in my opinion. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I absolutely loved this during voting and gave it high marks. It''s not surprising that it didn''t score higher considering its outstanding artistic quality. So I''m very happy to see that you received awards of peer appreciation, which are worth a lot, in my opinion.  ', '2008-05-28 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
