(4730558, 680316, 81042, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the many kind comments. The picture is of a young Maasai girl. It was taken in north central Tanzania. Africa is a wonderful continent filled with amazing people. Hopefully some of the images that I have the privilege to upload will give you a small glimpse in this awesome place.</td>', 'Thanks for the many kind comments. The picture is of a young Maasai girl. It was taken in north central Tanzania. Africa is a wonderful continent filled with amazing people. Hopefully some of the images that I have the privilege to upload will give you a small glimpse in this awesome place.', '2008-05-28 15:54:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4730565, 680014, 811, '<td valign="top">I absolutely loved this (I was one of your two tens).  The strong graphic lines, the deep blacks, the "mirror" of light and dark -- it was great.  I almost left the comment, "Perfect" while voting but  was afraid it would seem presumptious.  However, now that I see you were robbed, I will say it.  I think this shot is perfect -- it evokes that "I''m afraid even though there is nothing to be afraid of" feeling in me.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I absolutely loved this (I was one of your two tens).  The strong graphic lines, the deep blacks, the "mirror" of light and dark -- it was great.  I almost left the comment, "Perfect" while voting but  was afraid it would seem presumptious.  However, now that I see you were robbed, I will say it.  I think this shot is perfect -- it evokes that "I''m afraid even though there is nothing to be afraid of" feeling in me. ', '2008-05-28 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
